The public art advisory committee shall have the following powers and duties:
(1) The committee shall act as an advisory body to the mayor and the city council and as an advocate for public arts and aesthetics in all aspects of city life. It shall encourage, develop and support a variety of programs which reflect the cultural art needs and experience of all citizens and shall encourage participation by all citizens in the cultural art activities carried on in the city;
